<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0010933> rdfs:label "autosomal recessive nonsyndromic hearing loss 4" ;
    dcterms:description "An autosomal recessive nonsyndromic deafness that has material basis in mutation in the SLC26A4 gene on chromosome 7q22. Mutation in the FOXI1 gene has been found to be a rare cause of EVA. EVA may also be rarely caused by digenic inheritance of heterozygous mutations in the SLC26A4 and FOXI1 genes, or in the SLC26A4 and KCNJ10 genes." ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
    ns1:exact_synonym "enlarged vestibular aqueduct",
