<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0012438> rdfs:label "pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 5" ;
    dcterms:description "Pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 5 (PCH5) is a very rare severe form of PCH with prenatal onset and characterized by fetal onset of clonus or seizures-like activity persisting in infancy and microencephaly leading to early postnatal death. There is significant overlap both in phenotype and in genotype between pontocerebellar hypoplasia types 4 and 5."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
