    dcterms:description "X-linked intellectual deficit, Cilliers type is characterized by mild intellectual deficit associated with short stature, hypergonadotropic hypogonadism, microcephaly and mild facial dysmorphism (deep-set eyes, prominent supraorbital ridges, a high nasal bridge and large ears)."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
