<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0016035> rdfs:label "Nelson syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A syndrome that develops following bilateral adrenalectomy for Cushing syndrome. The signs and symptoms result from the presence of an adenocorticotropin-secreting pituitary gland adenoma, and include enlargement of the sella turcica and pressure on the adjacent structures, and skin hyperpigmentation."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
