<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0016102> rdfs:label "subacute inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A subacute progressive symmetric sensorial and/or motor disorder characterized by muscular weakness with impaired sensation, absent or diminished tendon reflexes and elevated cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) proteins. SIDP is an intermediate form between Guillain-Barre syndrome (GBS) and chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy (CIDP)." ;
