<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0016546> rdfs:label "primary orthostatic tremor" ;
    dcterms:description "Primary orthostatic tremor (POT), or ``shaky legs syndrome'', is a rare movement disorder characterized by fast, task-specific tremor, affecting the legs and trunk while standing." ;
