<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017364> rdfs:label "POEMS syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "POEMS syndrome is a paraneoplastic syndrome characterized by polyradiculoneuropathy (P), organomegaly (O), endocrinopathy (E), clonal plasma cell disorder (M), and skin changes (S). Other features include papilledema, extravascular volume overload, sclerotic bone lesions, thrombocytosis/erythrocytosis, and elevated VEGF levels."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
