<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017638> rdfs:label "manganese poisoning" ;
    dcterms:description "Manganese poisoning is associated with chronic inhalation of manganese particles by individuals who work with manganese ore. Clinical features include confusion; hallucinations; and an extrapyramidal syndrome (Parkinson disease, secondary) that includes rigidity; dystonia; retropulsion; and tremor. (Adams, Principles of Neurology, 6th ed, p1213)" ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
