<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019151> rdfs:label "oligocone trichromacy"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Oligocone trichromacy is a rare non-progressive form of cone photoreceptor dysfunction characterized by reduced visual acuity, normal retinal appearance, absent or reduced cone responses on electroretinography but normal color vision." ;
