<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019399> rdfs:label "Isaac syndrome" ;
    dcterms:description "Isaac's syndrome is an immune-mediated peripheral motor neuron disorder characterized by continuous muscle fiber activity at rest resulting in muscle stiffness, cramps, myokymia, and pseudomyotonia."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
