<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019421> rdfs:label "X-linked intellectual disability, Seemanova type"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "X-linked intellectual disability, Seemanova type is characterized by microcephaly, intellectual deficit, growth retardation and hypogenitalism. It has been described in four boys from one family. A characteristic facies and ophthalmologic anomalies were also present and included microphthalmia, microcornea and cataract. Transmission is X-linked." ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
