<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009760> rdfs:label "Antecubital pterygium" ;
    dcterms:description "Pterygium affecting the elbow. This is a cutaneous web that can lead to severe flexion contracture of the elbow joint. Antecubital pterygium can be unilateral, bilateral, symmetric, or asysmmetric." ;
