<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012774> rdfs:label "Increased upper to lower segment ratio" ;
    dcterms:description "Elevated ratio between the upper and the lower segment of the body, where the lower segment is defined as the length between the top of pubic symphysis to floor, and the upper segment is defined as the top of head to top of pubic symphysis." ;
