<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0007296> rdfs:label "spinocerebellar ataxia type 31"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Spinocerebellar ataxia type 31 (SCA31) is a very rare subtype of autosomal dominant cerebellar ataxia type III (ADCA type III) characterized by the late-onset of cerebral ataxia, dysarthria and horizontal gaze nystagmus, and that is occasionally accompanied by pyramidal signs, tremor, decreased vibration sense and hearing difficulties." ;
