<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008948> rdfs:label "cerebrotendinous xanthomatosis"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Cerebrotendinous xanthomatosis (CTX) is an anomaly of bile acid synthesis characterized by neonatal cholestasis, childhood-onset cataract, adolescent to young adult-onset tendon xanthomata, and brain xanthomata with adult-onset neurologic dysfunction."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
