<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008963> rdfs:label "Chediak-Higashi syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "ChC)diak-Higashi syndrome (CHS) is a rare severe genetic disorder generally characterized by partial oculocutaneous albinism (OCA), severe immunodeficiency, mild bleeding, neurological dysfunction and lymphoproliferative disorder. A classic, early-onset form and an attenuated, later-onset form (Atypical CHS) have been described." ;
