<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0010337> rdfs:label "X-linked intellectual disability-cerebellar hypoplasia syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "X-linked intellectual deficit-cerebellar hypoplasia, also known as OPHN1 syndrome, is a rare syndromic form of cerebellar dysgenesis characterized by moderate to severe intellectual deficit and cerebellar abnormalities."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
