<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0010417> rdfs:label "syndromic X-linked intellectual disability Najm type" ;
    dcterms:description "A rare cerebellar dysgenesis syndrome characterized by variable clinical manifestations ranging from mild intellectual deficit with or without congenital nystagmus, to severe cognitive impairment associated with cerebellar and pontine hypoplasia/atrophy and abnormalities of cortical development." ;
