<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0010661> rdfs:label "severe X-linked intellectual disability, Gustavson type"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Severe X-linked intellectual disability, Gustavson type is characterized by X-linked intellectual disability, microcephaly, optical atrophy with impaired vision or blindness, a severe hearing defect, facial dysmorphology, spasticity, epileptic seizures and restricted joint movement. It has been described in seven children from two generations of a Swedish family. All patients died in during early childhood." ;
