<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011025> rdfs:label "Cayman type cerebellar ataxia"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Cerebellar ataxia, Cayman type is characterized by psychomotor retardation, hypotonia and cerebellar dysfunction (nystagmus, ataxic gait, truncal ataxia, dysarthric speech and intention tremor), associated with cerebellar hypoplasia." ;
