<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011493> rdfs:label "Stickler syndrome type 2" ;
    dcterms:description "Stickler syndrome is an inherited vitreoretinopathy characterized by the association of ocular signs with more or less complete forms of Pierre-Robin sequence, bone disorders, and sensorineural deafness (10% of cases). Stickler syndrome type 2 is caused by mutations in the COL11A1 gene (1p21)."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
    ns1:exact_synonym "COL11A1 Stickler syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype>,
