<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011871> rdfs:label "Niemann-Pick disease type B" ;
    dcterms:description "Niemann-Pick disease type B is a mild subtype of Niemann-Pick disease, an autosomal recessive lysosomal disease, and is characterized clinically by onset in childhood with hepatosplenomegaly, growth retardation, and lung disorders such as infections and dyspnea"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
