<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011970> rdfs:label "rolandic epilepsy-paroxysmal exercise-induced dystonia-writer's cramp syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A rare genetic epilepsy syndrome characterized by infantile or childhood onset of focal motor seizures remitting with age, as well as childhood onset of exercise-induced dystonia which often persists into adulthood. Additional reported features include nystagmus and postural tremor of the hands."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
