<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0013656> rdfs:label "intellectual disability, autosomal dominant 9" ;
    dcterms:description "An autosomal dominant condition caused by mutation(s) in the KIF1A gene, encoding kinesin-like protein KIF1A. It is characterized by microcephaly, intellectual disability, and delayed psychomotor development. The condition is progressive, occurs in early infancy, and is of variable severity." ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
