<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0014572> rdfs:label "Lichtenstein-Knorr syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "An autosomal recessive spinocerebellar ataxia caused by disease-causing variants in the SLC9A1 gene, characterized by early-onset cerebellar ataxia, cognitive or developmental delay, seizure, and cerebellar atrophy. Patients may also present with varying degrees of nystagmus, oculomotor apraxia, amelogenesis imperfecta and sensorineural hearing loss."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
