<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0016564> rdfs:label "progressive supranuclear palsy-progressive non-fluent aphasia syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "PSP-progressive non fluent aphasia (PSP-PNFA) is an atypical variant of progressive supranuclear palsy (PSP), a rare late-onset neurodegenerative disease. Unlike classic PSP (Richardson syndrome) patients present with an isolated speech production problem years before developing other motor features of PSP."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
