    dcterms:description "A syndrome caused by early postzygotic mosaic gain-of-function mutations in EPAS1 (encoding hypoxia-inducible factor 2 alpha, HIF-2alpha), characterized by multiple paragangliomas, somatostatinomas, and polycythemia, with variable vascular malformations and neural tube defects."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
