<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019354> rdfs:label "Stickler syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Stickler syndrome is an inherited vitreoretinopathy characterized by the association of ocular signs with more or less complete forms of Pierre-Robin sequence, bone disorders, and sensorineural deafness (10% of cases)." ;
