<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0800043> rdfs:label "Stüve-Wiedemann syndrome 1" ;
    dcterms:description "A rare autosomal recessive congenital primary skeletal dysplasia, characterized by small stature, bowing of the long bones, camptodactyly, hyperthermic episodes, respiratory distress/apneic episodes and feeding difficulties that usually lead to early mortality."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
