<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0005521> rdfs:label "Disseminated intravascular coagulation" ;
    dcterms:description "Disseminated intravascular coagulation is characterized by the widespread activation of coagulation, which results in the intravascular formation of fibrin and ultimately thrombotic occlusion of small and midsize vessels." ;
