<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009553> rdfs:label "Abnormality of the hairline" ;
    dcterms:description "The hairline refers to the outline of hair of the head. An abnormality of the hairline can refer to an unusually low or high border between areas of the scalp with and without hair or to abnormal projections of scalp hair."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
