<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010953> rdfs:label "Noncommunicating hydrocephalus" ;
    dcterms:description "A form of hydrocephalus in which the flow of cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) within the cerebral ventricular system or in the outlets of the CSF to the arachnoid space is obstructed." ;
