<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011903> rdfs:label "HbH hemoglobin" ;
    dcterms:description "Hemoglobin H (HbH) contains four beta-globin chains. It is normally not present at all in blood, but may make up about 1-40 percent of all hemoglobin in HbH disease, a subform of alpha thalassemia."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
