    dcterms:description "The presence of spontaneous bursts of rapidly firing potentials that recur at regular intervals of 2-10 per second and are unaffected by voluntary effort. This is an electromyographic (EMG) finding." ;
    ns1:category ns1:PhenotypicFeature ;
