<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0410151> rdfs:label "Eosinophilic infiltration of the esophagus"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Infiltration of numerous eosinophils (usually greater than 15 per high power field) into the squamous epithelium of the esophagus, and layering of eosinophils on the surface layer of the esophagus." ;
