<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008675> rdfs:label "Freeman-Sheldon syndrome" ;
    dcterms:description "A very rare, multiple congenital contractures syndrome characterized by a microstomia with a whistling appearance of the mouth, distinctive facies, club foot and joint contractures. FSS is the most severe form of distal arthrogryposis."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
