<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0018160> rdfs:label "hereditary retinoblastoma" ;
    dcterms:description "An autosomal dominant disorder caused by pathogenic variants in the RB1 gene, characterized by an increased risk of retinoblastoma in early childhood. Individuals with hereditary retinoblastoma also have an increased risk of developing secondary cancers, such as osteosarcoma, melanoma and carcinomas in childhood and adulthood." ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
    ns1:exact_synonym "RB1-related retinoblastoma predisposition"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype>,
