<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0018342> rdfs:label "Joubert syndrome with Jeune asphyxiating thoracic dystrophy"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Joubert syndrome with Jeune asphyxiating thoracic dystrophy (JATD) is an extremely rare genetic bone disorder characterized by the classic features of Joubert syndrome (i.e. malformation of the brainstem causing ataxia, hypotonia,cognitive impairment, and abnormal eyemovements), associated with the skeletal anomalies found in JATD including short-rib dysplasia and narrow thorax causing respiratory failure, short limbs, and metaphyseal changes."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
    ns1:exact_synonym "Joubert syndrome with JATD"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype>,
