<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0018493> rdfs:label "malignant hyperthermia of anesthesia" ;
    dcterms:description "A pharmacogenetic disorder of skeletal muscle that presents as a hypermetabolic response to potent volatile anesthetic gasses such as halothane, sevoflurane, desflurane and the depolarizing muscle relaxant succinylcholine, and rarely, to stresses such as vigorous exercise and heat." ;
