<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0019951> rdfs:label "rigid spine syndrome"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Rigid spine syndrome (RSS) is a slowly progressive childhood-onset congenital muscular dystrophy characterized by contractures of the spinal extensor muscles associated with abnormal posture (limitation of neck and trunk flexure), progressive scoliosis of the spine, early marked cervico-axial muscle weakness with relatively preserved strength and function of the extremities and progressive respiratory insufficiency."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
