<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000485> rdfs:label "Megalocornea" ;
    dcterms:description "An enlargement of the cornea with normal clarity and function. Megalocornea is diagnosed with a horizontal corneal diameter of 12 mm or more at birth or 13 mm or more after two years of age." ;
