<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012032> rdfs:label "Lipoma" ;
    dcterms:description "Benign neoplasia derived from lipoblasts or lipocytes of white or brown fat. May be angiomatous or hibernomatous."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
