<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012075> rdfs:label "Personality disorder"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A personality disorder is a deeply ingrained pattern of behavior of a specified kind that deviates markedly from the norms of generally accepted behavior. It is typically apparent by the time of adolescence and causes long-term difficulties in personal relationships or functioning in society." ;
