<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002544> rdfs:label "Retrocollis"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A form of torticollis in which the head is drawn back, either due to a permanent contractures of neck extensor muscles, or to a spasmodic contracture." ;
