<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002920> rdfs:label "Decreased circulating ACTH concentration" ;
    dcterms:description "The concentration of corticotropin, also known as adrenocorticotropic hormone (ACTH), is below the lower limit of normal in the blood circulation."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
