<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002999> rdfs:label "Patellar dislocation" ;
    dcterms:description "The kneecap normally is located within the groove termed trochlea on the distal femur and can slide up and down in it. Patellar dislocation occurs if the patella fully dislocates out of the groove." ;
