<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007015> rdfs:label "Poor gross motor coordination" ;
    dcterms:description "An abnormality of the ability (skills) to perform a precise movement of large muscles with the intent to perform a specific act. Gross motor skills are required to mediate movements of the arms, legs, and other large body parts." ;
