<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010544> rdfs:label "Vertical nystagmus" ;
    dcterms:description "Vertical nystagmus may present with either up-beating or down-beating eye movements or both. When present in the straight-ahead position of gaze it is referred to as upbeat nystagmus or downbeat nystagmus."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
