<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011169> rdfs:label "Generalized clonic seizure" ;
    dcterms:description "Generalized clonic seizure is a type of generalized motor seizure characterized by sustained bilateral jerking, either symmetric or asymmetric, that is regularly repetitive and involves the same muscle groups." ;
