<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007984> rdfs:label "ERG: Reduced dark-adapted b-wave amplitude" ;
    dcterms:description "A dark-adapted bright flash electroretinogram in which the b-wave that is of markedly lower amplitude than the associated a-wave."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
