<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031358> rdfs:label "Vegetative state" ;
    dcterms:description "The absence of wakefulness and consciousness, but in contrast to a coma, there is involuntary opening of the eyes and movements such as teeth grinding, yawning, or thrashing of the extremities." ;
