<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031956> rdfs:label "Elevated circulating aspartate aminotransferase concentration" ;
    dcterms:description "The concentration of aspartate aminotransferase (AST) in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." ;
