<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017219> rdfs:label "microform holoprosencephaly"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "Microform holoprosencephaly is a benign form of holoprosencephaly (HPE) characterized by midline defects without the typical HPE defect in brain cleavage." ;
