    dcterms:description "Short distance from the end of the finger to the most distal interphalangeal crease or the distal interphalangeal joint flexion point. That is, hypoplasia of one or more of the distal phalanx of finger."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    ns1:category ns1:PhenotypicFeature ;
    ns1:exact_synonym "Hypoplasia of the distal phalanges of the hand"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype>,
