<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0002002> rdfs:label "Deep philtrum" ;
    dcterms:description "Accentuated, prominent philtral ridges giving rise to an exaggerated groove in the midline between the nasal base and upper vermillion border."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
