<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001773> rdfs:label "Short foot" ;
    dcterms:description "A measured foot length that is more than 2 SD below the mean for a newborn of 27 - 41 weeks gestation, or foot that is less than the 3rd centile for individuals from birth to 16 years of age (objective). Alternatively, a foot that appears disproportionately short (subjective)." ;
