<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000411> rdfs:label "Protruding ear" ;
    dcterms:description "Angle formed by the plane of the ear and the mastoid bone greater than the 97th centile for age (objective); or, outer edge of the helix more than 2 cm from the mastoid at the point of maximum distance (objective)."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
