<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001266> rdfs:label "Choreoathetosis" ;
    dcterms:description "Involuntary movements characterized by both athetosis (inability to sustain muscles in a fixed position) and chorea (widespread jerky arrhythmic movements)."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
