<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001263> rdfs:label "Global developmental delay" ;
    dcterms:description "A delay in the achievement of motor or mental milestones in the domains of development of a child, including motor skills, speech and language, cognitive skills, and social and emotional skills. This term should only be used to describe children younger than five years of age." ;
